<title>USA: Praxair Inc Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Praxair Inc Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.59		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net		 96,000		   66,000</p>
<p> Sales	     1,151,000		807,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  163,472		  145,987</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.77		    $1.82</p>
<p> Net		 282,000		  262,000</p>
<p> Sales	     4,449,000		3,146,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  159,037		  144,147</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the quarter and year ended December 31, 1996, include a $22 million and $101 million decrease, respectively, in sales; a $7 million and $23 million decrease, respectively, in operating profit; and, a $4 million and $13 million decrease, respectively, in net income from currency translation effects worldwide as compared to the 1995 pro forma results.</p>
</text>
